actor "Service Provider" as Users
boundary CapabilityProfilePage
control serviceProviderProfileController
participant ":serviceProviderProfileService" as Service
participant ":serviceProviderProfileModel" as Model
database Database

activate Users
Users->CapabilityProfilePage: 1. Click "Capability Profile"
activate CapabilityProfilePage
CapabilityProfilePage->serviceProviderProfileController: 2. Get capability profile data
activate serviceProviderProfileController
serviceProviderProfileController->Service: 3. getCapabilityProfile(userId)
activate Service
Service->Model: 4. findByUserId(userId)
activate Model
Model->Database: 5. findOne()
activate Database
Database-->Model: 6. Return profile document (or null)
deactivate Database
Model-->Service: 7. Return raw result
deactivate Model
Service->Service: 8. checkQuerySuccess()
activate Service
space
deactivate Service

    alt Capability profile not found
        Service-->serviceProviderProfileController: 8.1 Return error: profile not found
        serviceProviderProfileController-->CapabilityProfilePage: 8.1.1 Return error
        CapabilityProfilePage-->Users: 8.1.2 Display error: profile not found
    else Capability profile found
        Service-->serviceProviderProfileController: 8.2. Return success + capability data
        deactivate Service
        serviceProviderProfileController-->CapabilityProfilePage: 8.2.1 Return success and capability data
        deactivate serviceProviderProfileController
       
        CapabilityProfilePage-->Users: 8.2.2 Display capability and service areas
        deactivate CapabilityProfilePage
        deactivate Users
    end
```